      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-19T18:24:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you explain the change here a bit more?\n\nGATT disconnect reason defined here: https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/include/gatt_api.h;l\u003d268?q\u003dhci_err_connection_tout%20gatt\u0026ss\u003dh%2Fgoogleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%2F%2B%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmain\n\n0x08 maps to the HCI status code returned in events from the controller: https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/include/hci_error_code.h;drc\u003d55d5fd8850e60ad5818b3d6c1e60de450bb5d52e;l\u003d38\n\nI\u0027m wondering if it makes sense to deduplicate this from that event and define a separate event in tGATT_DISCONN_REASON for this scenario. WDYT?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 466,
        "startChar": 55,
        "endLine": 466,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "b0a475f7d6aeda2312ec3b7562267060963a3cb1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "89a43576_4586c307",
        "filename": "system/stack/gatt/gatt_main.cc",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 466,
      "author": {
        "id": 1948078
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-22T10:21:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So when connection timeout happens after 30s, [on_create_connection_timeout](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/hci/acl_manager/le_impl.h;l\u003d1112?q\u003dle_impl.h\u0026sq\u003drepo:%22googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%22%20branch:%22main%22) in le_impl.h is actually called with the HCI status code for connection timeout and gets carried over to callbacks until [acl_ble_connection_fail](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/acl/ble_acl.cc;l\u003d130?q\u003dacl_ble_connection_fail\u0026sq\u003drepo:%22googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%22%20branch:%22main%22).\n\nHowever from this point, [on_connection_timed_out](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/gatt/gatt_main.cc;l\u003d465;drc\u003ddb09c842a8d0e91c6a47bb09ace901eca2dd6ef9) in gatt_api.h is called and assigns the GATT disconnection reason as 0xff or 255 (unknown), when the original reason was actually the HCI status code 0x08. That\u0027s why I thought it would make sense to change this to 0x08, but please let me know if I should just define a separate event!",
      "parentUuid": "c7501370_73eea5c4",
